message: >-
  If you use antibody-utils in published work, please cite it as below, and
  the methods and data it implements that your work relies on: see
  https://antibody-utils.readthedocs.io/en/latest/citing.html.
title: antibody-utils
abstract: >-
  Utilities for antibody sequence and structure analysis: numbering, region
  definitions, sequence comparison, VH/VL orientation and more.
